title: Password-Protected Archive Attachment
id: 540949b3-5139-4dc5-8f6a-a25f1c575d1c
status: experimental
description: Detects password-protected archive attachments (encrypted .zip/.rar/.7z) with the password supplied in the email body, a technique to smuggle malware past attachment scanning that cannot inspect encrypted content.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/001/
logsource:
  category: mail
detection:
  selection:
    attachment_encrypted: true
    attachment_name|endswith:
      - '.zip'
      - '.rar'
      - '.7z'
    body|contains: 'password'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - sender
  - recipient
  - subject
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate encrypted document exchange
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1566.001
